      "description": "Participant-replan workflow (ADR 0459/0463), migrated from the deprecated builtin (ADR 0472 P4). chainId keeps the original id; the falsy reject-safe barrier rides RFC 0134. 1.0.3 declares `actions: [approve, reject]` on the approval gate (maxRequestChangesIterations 0), so an unmade decision is refused instead of recorded as a decline. 1.0.4 (WF-FAIL-2): a failed enrich stops the run (enrich-fail) instead of skipping the approval gate and applying the revision unapproved.",
